Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:51.26,JOJO5-op1-jp-2,,0,0,0,fx,Аударма: Xianyu Tiyan, Dabu Lu; Субтитрлар: Xiao Wu, Gen Cuonan, AB; Өңдеу: Kuma Star's Wayward Sheep
