Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.16,0:02:05.56,JOJO5-op1-jp-2,,0,0,0,fx,Аударма: Xianyu Tiyan, Dabu Lu; Субтитрлар: Xiao Wu, Gen Cuonan, AB; Өңдеу: Kuma Star's Wayward Sheep
